":{"clickTrackingParams":"CI4CEM2rARgBIhMIi8HK_8G-kgMV_-ZJBx0VLTjiygEE4NhV0Q==","commandExecutorCommand":{"commands":[{"clickTrackingParams":"CI4CEM2rARgBIhMIi8HK_8G-kgMV_-ZJBx0VLTjiygEE4NhV0Q==","changeEngagementPanelVisibilityAction":{"targetId":"engagement-panel-structured-description","visibility":"ENGAGEMENT_PANEL_VISIBILITY_EXPANDED"}},{"clickTrackingParams":"CI4CEM2rARgBIhMIi8HK_8G-kgMV_-ZJBx0VLTjiygEE4NhV0Q==","scrollToEngagementPanelCommand":{"targetId":"engagement-panel-structured-description"}}]}},"showLessCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CI4CEM2rARgBIhMIi8HK_8G-kgMV_-ZJBx0VLTjiygEE4NhV0Q==","changeEngagementPanelVisibilityAction":{"targetId":"engagement-panel-structured-description","visibility":"ENGAGEMENT_PANEL_VISIBILITY_HIDDEN"}},"attributedDescription":{"content":"Wash tunnel price, installation plan\u0026drawing please consult Michael\n+86-13736460260 | hbklove6@gmail.com\n\nWash tunnel description\nAutomatic Car Wash Tunnel Machine with 9 brushes allow 3 cars washing in tunnel Simultaneously, 1 minute to finish per car washing. 0.1KWH water \u0026 power means high return on investment, it can wash 300+ cars daily without stop.\n\nWash Tunnel Features\nAuto conveyor\nUnderbody\nHigh-pressure water\n1 Top Brush\n2 Wheel brushes\n2 small brushes\n4 vertical brushes\nWax arch\nLava foam arch\n4 fixed dryers\nLed indicator screen\n\nFAQ(frequently asked question) 1, the tunnel waste a lot of water?\nThe piston pump equipped with 15kW motor, flow rate is 100L/min, normally running at 80L/min.\nThe answer for waste water is real, the tunnel is not suitable to be used in some countries where the water is expensive or lack of water.\n\nFAQ(frequently asked question) 2, How much is the price of the wash tunnel?\nWash tunnel price, installation plan\u0026drawing please consult Michael\nWhatsapp/Wechat +86-13736460260\nEmail hbklove6@gmail.com\n\nFAQ(frequently asked question) 3, The brushes(fabric) gonna scratch/swirl to damage my car paint?\nThe fabric here in this videos is EVA foam brush, which is #softtouch technology with 400,000 washes life time, soft touching the paint gentlely with low water absorb property, so it is light(not heavily crash on paint).\nYes the brushes gonna damage the car paint in case:\n     1, the brushes running in cold winter with lots of ice attached\n     2, the paint was not complete, example some rusted scars existed on paint.\nMeanwhile, if the #softtouch fabric is not good enough, then clients can by whatever the brushes you need,  the tunnel caters for suitable flange for special brush.\n\nFAQ(frequently asked question) 4, Do you have a plastic flat silent conveyor?\nDual plastic conveyor option is now available, check video:\n   • WASH TUNNEL DUAL PLASTIC BELT CONVEYOR MAN...  \n\nFAQ(frequently asked question) 5, The car in this video is a clean car?\nMaybe you need a dirty car clean video:\n   • WASH GANTRY ROLL OVER CAR WASH SYSTEM JUBO...  \n   • ROLLOVER CAR WASH - WASH GANTRY MADE IN CH...  \n\nFAQ(frequently asked question) 6, How to clean inside car?\nYou need a vacuum, we have both central vacuum and independent vacuum for choice.\n\nIf the answer is not clear, please consult Michael \nWhatsapp/Wechat +86-13736460260\nemail hbklove6@gmail.com","commandRuns":[{"startIndex":1208,"length":10,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CJACENzXBBgLIhMIi8HK_8G-kgMV_-ZJBx0VLTjiygEE4NhV0Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/softtouch","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe":6827,"apiUrl":"/youtubei/v1/browse"}},"browseEndpoint":{"browseId":"FEhashtag","params":"6gUNCglzb2Z0dG91Y2gYAQ%3D%3D"}}},"loggingDirectives":{"trackingParams":"CJACENzXBBgLIhMIi8HK_8G-kgMV_-ZJBx0VLTji"}},{"startIndex":1589,"length":10,"onTap":{"innertubeCommand":{"clickTrackingParams":"CI8CENzXBBgMIhMIi8HK_8G-kgMV_-ZJBx0VLTjiygEE4NhV0Q==","commandMetadata":{"webCommandMetadata":{"url":"/hashtag/softtouch","webPageType":"WEB_PAGE_TYPE_BROWSE","rootVe":6827,"apiUrl":"/youtub